{"unit_id":"waknow__dsh-web-icon-indicator#card-zh","repo":"waknow/dsh-web-icon-indicator","commit":"13c1743d148e8bcdfe4564c8bf06f835914ce978","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-icon-indicator 是一款适用于 DSH Web 客户端的标签页图标状态提示插件。它在宿主侧监听 agent 状态并汇总为待机、运行中、提问和完成，再通过 Web 路由提供状态与基础 SVG，并向页面注入浏览器脚本，将状态绘制到 favicon。主要功能包括状态优先级显示、提问和完成状态驻留、多 agent 活跃数量显示，以及颜色和动画效果配置；设置页面可编辑配色、特效与驻留时间。适合同时查看多个 DSH 会话、希望在后台标签页辨认 agent 是否需要关注的用户。默认使用内置图标与本机 Web 服务，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1027","lib/index.js:1235-1300","lib/client.js:1363-1459"]}
{"unit_id":"waknow__dsh-web-icon-indicator#card-en","repo":"waknow/dsh-web-icon-indicator","commit":"13c1743d148e8bcdfe4564c8bf06f835914ce978","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-icon-indicator reflects DSH agent states in the browser tab favicon using a colored SVG. It marks idle, running, asking, and done, and shows the active-agent count when several are busy. A settings card controls colors, effects, and hold times. It needs no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1027","lib/index.js:1235-1300","lib/client.js:1363-1459"]}
