{"unit_id":"waknow__dsh-web-icon-indicator#feature-1","repo":"waknow/dsh-web-icon-indicator","commit":"13c1743d148e8bcdfe4564c8bf06f835914ce978","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件「会话状态图标」：把 agent 状态聚合为待机、运行、提问或完成，并按优先级更新浏览器标签页 favicon。提问与完成状态支持最短驻留时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1027","lib/index.js:1030-1073"]}
